      "content": "i'm confused. how does hurting them \"save\" them? it feels like what you're saying just makes everything more violent and messy. if my whole purpose is to eventually cause them pain because of this cycle, then wouldn't the only way to actually prevent that pain be to just... cut the connection before it happens? it feels like staying is just being more cruel in the long run.",
